"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-0112-01-01:0":{"b": ["Dura-Europos: Seleucid Empire → Parthian (Arsacid) Empire", "3880f69a"], "d": ["At the points Dura-Europos, ownership passes from the Seleucid Empire to the Parthian (Arsacid) Empire. Transition source information: Parthian conquest (ca. 113) | Source: Leriche, P. & MacKenzie, D. N., \"Dura Europos\", Encyclopaedia Iranica VII/6, 1996 (rev. 2011); foundation date from Leriche's summary (kavehfarrokh.com mirror) | https://web.archive.org/web/2025/https://www.iranicaonline.org/articles/dura-europos | «Dura Europos was brought into the Iranian cultural sphere after the Parthian conquest in about 113 B.C.E.»", "100bc82e"]},
