"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-0206-01-01:0":{"b": ["Xi'an (Chang'an): Qin Dynasty (unified Empire) → ownerless interval", "beaf3b60"], "d": ["At the points Xi'an (Chang'an), ownership passes from the Qin Dynasty (unified Empire) to the ownerless interval. Transition source information: Shiji 6, Qin Shi Huang, 26th year: 'for the first time unified the whole land' (change of the identity of the Qin state; Chang'an/Xianyang is the Qin core)", "baefa645"]},
"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-0211-01-01:0":{"b": ["Syracuse, Syrakusai: Syracuse (Syrakousai) → Roman Republic", "92a5bd9e"], "d": ["At the points Syracuse, Syrakusai, ownership passes from Syracuse (Syrakousai) to the Roman Republic. Transition source information: Livy 25.40: Marcellus settled Sicily 'captis Syracusis'; Eutropius 3.14: Marcellus took the greater part of Sicily and Syracuse.", "4e52db49"]},
