"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-0395-01-01:0":{"b": ["Veii: Etruscan City-States (Twelve-City League) → Roman Republic", "94377ac0"], "d": ["At the points Veii, ownership passes from the Etruscan City-States (Twelve-City League) to the Roman Republic. Transition source information: Livy 5.22 (Roberts, Perseus 1999.02.0026): after all human property had been carried off from Veii, the statue of Juno was taken to Rome; the city was taken. The BCE year is not in Livy (the year of the consul/dictator Camillus is matched with the Fasti).", "afe95710"]},
