"OLAYLAR_ARKEOLOJI_ZINCIR:-2003-01-01:0":{"b": ["Uruk, Ur: Kingdom of Larsa → ownerless interval", "ccf19f18"], "d": ["At the points Uruk, Ur, ownership passes from the Kingdom of Larsa to the ownerless interval. Transition source information: Ur-Namma year 1 = MC 2110; Ur III state | Source: Sallaberger, W. & Schrakamp, I. (eds.) 2015, ARCANE III: History & Philology, Brepols (Kisim I; Middle Chronology=MC), p. 131; Table 39 p. 136 | http://www.assyriologie.uni-muenchen.de/personen/professoren/sallaberger/publ_sallaberger/wasa_schrakamp_2015_arcane1.pdf | «Urnamma 18 years MC 2110-2093»", "521220da"]},
